The attribution must identify VIUK-Light and link to https://viuk-light.org/.
Use "原作：VIUK-Light" or "Original work by VIUK-Light", with the URL written
out if the interface cannot support a working link.

Do not hide or obscure the attribution. A source comment, a LICENSE or NOTICE
